### 1. GET Collection: List all books (200 OK)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books
Accept: application/json

### 2. GET Item: Find existing book by ID (200 OK)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books/1
Accept: application/json

### 3. GET Item: Missing ID -> 404 Not Found (ProblemDetail RFC 9457)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books/999
Accept: application/json

### 4. POST: Create a new valid book -> 201 Created + Location Header
POST http://localhost:8080/api/books
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "title": "Design Patterns: Elements of Reusable Object-Oriented Software",
  "author": "Erich Gamma, Richard Helm, Ralph Johnson, John Vlissides",
  "year": 1994,
  "genre": "SCIENCE"
}

### 5. PUT: Update an existing book -> 200 OK
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/books/1
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "title": "Effective Java 3rd Edition",
  "author": "Joshua Bloch",
  "year": 2018,
  "genre": "SCIENCE"
}

### 6. DELETE: Delete existing book -> 204 No Content
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/books/1

### 7. DELETE: Repeat DELETE of the same book -> 404 Not Found (ProblemDetail)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/books/1

### 8. Error Route 1: Missing Book (404 Not Found)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books/999
Accept: application/problem+json

### 9. Error Route 2: Validation failure - Empty title -> 400 Bad Request
POST http://localhost:8080/api/books
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/problem+json

{
  "title": "",
  "author": "Martin Fowler",
  "year": 2002,
  "genre": "SCIENCE"
}

### 10. Error Route 3: Duplicate title & author conflict -> 409 Conflict
POST http://localhost:8080/api/books
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/problem+json

{
  "title": "Clean Code",
  "author": "Robert Martin",
  "year": 2008,
  "genre": "NON_FICTION"
}

### 11. Variant 2: Sorting and filtering (?sort=year,desc&genre=SCIENCE)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books?sort=year,desc&genre=SCIENCE
Accept: application/json

### 12. Variant 2: Unknown sort field -> 400 Bad Request (ProblemDetail)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books?sort=isbn,desc
Accept: application/problem+json

### 13. OpenAPI Specification: JSON Document
GET http://localhost:8080/v3/api-docs
Accept: application/json

### 14. Swagger UI: Web Interface
GET http://localhost:8080/swagger-ui.html
